          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/8f1a1a1e38af465ab8d3b643bd3cd7c3_l05b03-los-fines-de-semana-salia-con-mis-vecinos.mp3?Expires=1794099527&Signature=Y24PxZ9FM4DhgkF3GdNzbmvXHirxVSj6UsVssOSyKBMFe7BUAGJshcq27yPuquNFuLguAwn0cQKRDFGADvjs3xk~l6RVwvxKMhiJToNovZM6QGGb~DTvBwMVDazDZYo1v~ij8Jz~dG~w9wfrYy5gKEHv0o8rCXPxoG-Xxym-VYQ8PPr~-0bvfajCn6CD~HS6hpY571YM2HFet5hD22aEcQ0r0t4WoeKG14Lvnangu4xH9KN7E-vZEpbxCqHjcqiDBd3WuuVBjsHzw5-XnMidkLkZtyVADRpYsdX3W2K3ogSNIAswp8dLWMx2unv8xyvJiZ9xdL5lX6dFXj5hEhDa6g__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
